@Api = http://localhost:5220

### ===================== 1. Redis Pub/Sub =====================

### PUBLISH notifications "hello"  => receivedBy: 3 (3 worker replikası)
POST {{Api}}/api/pubsub/publish?channel=notifications&message=hello

### Dinleyeni olmayan kanal => receivedBy: 0, mesaj kayboldu (No Persistence)
POST {{Api}}/api/pubsub/publish?channel=nobody&message=hello

### PSUBSCRIBE örnekleri (user.* | order.*.created | logs.*.error)
POST {{Api}}/api/pubsub/publish-samples

### Kullanım senaryosu: cache invalidation
POST {{Api}}/api/pubsub/use-cases/cache-invalidate/product:1

### Kullanım senaryosu: config change broadcast
POST {{Api}}/api/pubsub/use-cases/config-changed?name=FeatureX&value=on

### SPUBLISH live.scores (Sharded Pub/Sub)
POST {{Api}}/api/pubsub/sharded/publish?message=GS 2-1 FB

### PUBSUB CHANNELS / NUMSUB / NUMPAT
GET {{Api}}/api/pubsub/channels

### ===================== 2. Pub/Sub EventBus =====================

POST {{Api}}/api/events/order-created?total=250

###
POST {{Api}}/api/events/payment-processed?orderId=ORD-1&success=true

### ===================== 3. Redis Streams - Producer =====================

### XADD sensors * sensor-id 1234 temp 19.8  (Worker XREAD BLOCK ile canlı okur)
POST {{Api}}/api/streams/sensors?sensorId=1234&temp=19.8

### XADD orders => g1 grubunda 3 consumer'a paylaştırılır, analytics grubu hepsini alır
POST {{Api}}/api/streams/orders?count=6

### XADD payments => bazıları "çöker", XAUTOCLAIM ile kurtarılır, 3 denemede olmazsa DLQ
POST {{Api}}/api/streams/payments?count=10

### XADD logs MAXLEN ~ 1000 *
POST {{Api}}/api/streams/logs?count=2500&approximate=true

### ===================== 4. Okuma & Yönetim =====================

### XRANGE sensors - + COUNT 10
GET {{Api}}/api/streams/sensors/range

### XREVRANGE orders + - COUNT 3
GET {{Api}}/api/streams/orders/revrange?count=3

### XLEN + XINFO STREAM + XINFO GROUPS
GET {{Api}}/api/streams/orders/info

### XPENDING payments payment-processors
GET {{Api}}/api/streams/payments/groups/payment-processors/pending

### Dead-letter stream
GET {{Api}}/api/streams/payments:dlq/range

### XTRIM logs MAXLEN 500
POST {{Api}}/api/streams/logs/trim?maxLength=500

### XTRIM sensors MINID <10 dk önce>
POST {{Api}}/api/streams/sensors/trim-by-time?olderThanMinutes=10

### XDEL sensors <id>
DELETE {{Api}}/api/streams/sensors/entries/1700000000000-0
